2EC81B"}, "display_name": "Tabletop Basketball AR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\"Tabletop Basketball AR\" for Oculus Quest stands out as an avant-garde blend of traditional basketball gameplay and cutting-edge augmented reality (AR) technology. This game offers players an immersive experience that transforms any tabletop into a dynamic 3-on-3 basketball arena. It ingeniously combines the physical skill and strategy of basketball with the interactive capabilities of AR, providing a gaming experience like no other.\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Dynamic AR Gameplay: Turn any tabletop into a basketball court with immersive AR technology.\n- Multiplayer Viewing Experience: Join games within the same environment.\n- Intuitive Controls: Designed for Oculus Touch controllers, suitable for all skill levels.\n- Realistic Graphics and Sound: High-quality graphics and immersive sound effects enhance the experience.\n- Regular Updates: Continuous game improvements and new content based on player feedback.\n\t\nWhat sets this game apart is its remarkable use of AR technology. The game transforms any flat surface into a virtual basketball court, allowing players to move around and view the game from multiple angles. This feature not only adds a layer of realism to the gameplay but also brings an innovative twist to the traditional sports gaming genre.", "short_description": "\"Tabletop Basketball AR\" is an Oculus Quest game that merges the excitement of basketball with augmented reality. In this 3-on-3 basketball game, players experience a full-fledged basketball match, enjoying the thrill of the court from a unique, tabletop perspective. The game offers an immersive, interactive experience, combining the strategy and skill of basketball with the innovative technology of AR, perfect for both sports enthusiasts and gamers seeking a novel gaming experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.redzonestudios.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_servi